<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel violence continues in Mexico as police shot a U.S. girl dead while pursuing a cartel, and three police officers were killed in an armed attack on a Guatemalan lawmaker. A cartel leader accused of protecting ex-Olympian Ryan Wedding was killed, while farmer kidnappings and village abductions illustrate the cartels' grip on rural communities. Federal prosecutors in Georgia dismantled three cartel-linked drug rings, seizing large drug shipments, and a suspected Sinaloa member was arrested in Metro Detroit with cocaine seized. Ismael &amp;quot;El Mayo&amp;quot; Zambada, alleged co-founder of the Sinaloa Cartel, was sentenced in Brooklyn. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNc3d2VFhsUzJucjhiOHdzTnBuU0VDNF9PcEV3c2VvQ2FlQ3lZM2k5VXF3TXlseFJaMDlkekVxT19GUHJvbG1VdHdfbmNRWi1MdU9zdXpGVjJCSkhXc0NOSXVseldlXzZvOU1NVlJmaFlqNUlkUkJFeHFPZ2ZIRjNkdE5vb2Ixd01LVGttWEluTTNnakkybGVtMlFfM2VHcGVqbzBFbWJWWDNFcWVTSmJGWFdmRWlVVG9tS3hpcmVtQ3Jpd04yRmdKeg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQNnJnWlVMYkUwX0hPQjVtXzZnNzhBUDhwczhNdnB0dVA3OTJnYTExdnV6ZjRya3M1UUo2TXUyT1l6U0ZRZmh2eUVRNWtJMFBDY2pMQWhaNU9yNm9NWHZGU1UzY2N1TDhwTnh1UXVNNG1YNFBWR2FWZDEzV01mMW0wS1hOcE9hZU1hbFJiaHEtZ0o2SW84T3Q4NDlOYjRTcFdPRnE2SXIzMjFQVHA3UVNZbm1ZaTF2TDhZeXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOQmFPeWtrNVdyT0NLOS1HemZOcjF5dkZ0bUwtY1hwY0dWWkdWbE1aVy1nekhsenIyLTZxZW1yN0oteXIzRFlVYnRZSm1aR3k2Q1FyandfVXNnQUFmVEZrZVpLZkxJSUlpUE1yYmVFMDE1M3JLekN5a1Nwclk5T05QbTNvYXQ1anlKeXYwbWhNem5ydE5GUkRNbXlPYWhZb1YyRTVpLXhNc2NzQ1hNWVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ratopati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a h